From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: At30c <173511395+At30c@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:07:50 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] FotaAgent: check the ROM update manifest instead of Samsung

Adds io.unica.fota.UpdateChecker and PartProxy (built from src/) and
uses them for the periodic check (5-10 minutes after registration, then
daily) and for the Settings check button. Packages published in parts
are served as one file on 127.0.0.1 by PartProxy.
